  "definition": "Underwriting and Issue Requirements",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-06-10",
  "historyNote": "#9690, eff 4-9-10; ss by #9938, eff 6-10-11; ss by #10212, eff 11-1-12 (from Ins 4103.04); ss by #12799,eff 6-10-19",
